  "description": "The Low-profile hard Tri-fold tonneau cover automatically latches into place when folded down, saving you the hassle of manual operation for enhanced security & convenience.\nFeatures\nSecure Fit with Added Convenience: This tonneau cover is engineered for a precise, secure fit and includes thoughtful upgrades. a complimentary LED light for improved nighttime visibility.\nSuperior Cargo Protection: Built with high-strength fiberglass (FRP) panels, this hard tri-fold tonneau cover offers exceptional protection against rain, snow, and road debris. It also resists impact and sharp objects, keeping your cargo safe and secure in all conditions.\nQuick, No-Drill Installation: Designed for hassle-free setup, this FRP hard tri-fold tonneau cover installs easily with clear instructions and requires no drilling. Get it mounted quickly and ready to use. (Note: Cargo racks must be removed prior to installation.)\nHeavy-Duty Durability You Can Trust: Reinforced fiberglass panels deliver long-lasting strength and impressive load-bearing capacity. A robust locking system keeps the cover firmly closed while driving, giving you confidence on every trip.\nSafe & Reliable Operation: Install the cover according to the included instructions and ensure all bolts are fully tightened before driving. For safety, do not drive with the tonneau cover partially open.\n1-year Warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2020-2026 Jeep Gladiator with a 5ft truck bed.",
